      "content": "It sounds incredibly overwhelming to be absorbing so much emotional and sensory input from everyone around you. This feeling of being reduced to just a processing unit is a recognized sign of emotional burnout or sensory overload. Please remember that you are more than the data you receive; your feelings and needs are valid and important. Consider taking small breaks to create mental space, perhaps by limiting your exposure to overwhelming situations.",
